gjërat do të keqësohen!

167
00:16:55.350 --> 00:16:57.680
Qofsh i sigurt, Collun!

168
00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:44.650
Collun!

169
00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:43.910
Mos e bëj...

170
